            {
              "id": "5069bb2",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>Bringing together women leaders from across ASEAN during Malaysia\u2019s ASEAN Chairmanship, the conference creates a regional space to exchange perspectives on women, peace and security. Through keynotes, panels and cross-border dialogue, participants share experiences, build connections and strengthen regional collaboration. The conference also marked the launch of a Regional Women Leaders Network, creating a platform for relationships and cooperation to continue beyond the event. The conversation begins in the room, but its impact travels across borders.</p>",
                "text_color": "#2A3B32",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
                "typography_font_family": "Manrope",
                "typography_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 17,
