              "id": "ad45968",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"font-family:'Inria Serif',serif;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.5;color:#1B4332;margin:0 0 18px\">&ldquo;The conference reminded me that peace and security are not distant policy conversations. They begin with whose experiences are heard, who has a seat at the table, and who gets to shape the decisions that affect our communities.&rdquo;</p><p style=\"font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:.86rem;color:#6E7468;margin:0\"><b style=\"color:#1B4332\">Conference participant</b></p>",
